<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de" data-theme="light">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Qualitätsaktien Watchlist | Amana Aktien</title>
<meta name="description" content="Täglich aktualisierte deutsche Qualitätsaktien Watchlist mit Halal-Status und Kursen.">

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@700;900&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root {
  --bg:#F8F6F1;
  --bg2:#FFFFFF;
  --bg3:#F0EDE6;
  --text:#1A1814;
  --text2:#444;
  --muted:#888;
  --border:rgba(160,120,48,.22);
  --gold:#A07830;
  --green:#2D7A55;
  --radius: 12px;
}

* { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
body { font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; background:var(--bg); color:var(--text); line-height:1.7; }

.hero {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a2f22 0%, #2a4635 100%);
  padding: 4.5rem 2rem 3rem;
  text-align: center;
  color: white;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.hero::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: -150px; left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  width: 700px; height: 700px;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(160,120,48,0.15) 0%, transparent 60%);
  border-radius: 50%;
}
.hero h1 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
  font-weight: 900;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.hero p { max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto 2rem; font-size: 1.05rem; opacity: 0.9; }

.controls {
  max-width: 1280px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 2rem;
  display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center;
}
.search-wrap { position: relative; flex: 1; min-width: 260px; }
.search-wrap svg { position: absolute; left: 14px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); color: var(--muted); }
input[type="text"], select {
  width: 100%; padding: 12px 14px 12px 42px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius);
  background: var(--bg2); font-size: 15px;
}
input:focus, select:focus { border-color: var(--gold); outline: none; }

.filter-btn {
  padding: 11px 18px; border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--bg2);
  cursor: pointer; font-weight: 500;
}
.filter-btn:hover, .filter-btn.active {
  background: var(--gold); color: white; border-color: var(--gold);
}

.table-wrap { max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto 3rem; padding: 0 2rem; overflow-x: auto; }
table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: var(--bg2); border-radius: var(--radius); overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--border); }
thead th {
  padding: 14px 16px; text-align: left; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  background: var(--bg3); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); cursor: pointer;
}
tbody tr { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); transition: background 0.2s; }
tbody tr:hover { background: #f9f7f2; }
td { padding: 16px; vertical-align: middle; }

.stock-name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.02rem; }
.stock-symbol {
  display: inline-block; padding: 2px 7px; background: #f0ede6;
  border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--gold);
}
.change-cell.positive { color: var(--green); }
.change-cell.negative { color: #c2410c; }
.halal-yes { background: #e6f0eb; color: var(--green); }
.halal-check { background: #fef9c3; color: #92400e; }

.disclaimer {
  max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto 2rem; padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
  background: #fefce8; border: 1px solid #fef08a; border-radius: var(--radius);
  font-size: 0.85rem; color: #713f12;
}
footer {
  background: var(--bg2); border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 2.5rem 2rem; text-align: center; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted);
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="site-nav"></div>
<script src="nav.js?v=1.3"></script>

<section class="hero">
  <h1>Deutsche Qualitätsaktien Watchlist</h1>
  <p>Täglich aktualisierte Kurse • AAOIFI-Halal-Screening • Analysten-Einschätzungen</p>
</section>

<div class="controls">
  <div class="search-wrap">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"/></svg>
    <input type="text" id="search" placeholder="Aktie oder Symbol suchen..." oninput="applyFilters()">
  </div>
  <select id="sector-filter" onchange="applyFilters()"></select>
  <button class="filter-btn active" onclick="setHalalFilter('all',this)">Alle</button>
  <button class="filter-btn" onclick="setHalalFilter('yes',this)">✓ Halal</button>
  <button class="filter-btn" onclick="setHalalFilter('check',this)">⚠ Prüfen</button>
  <select id="sort-metric" onchange="applyFilters()">
    <option value="default">Sortierung: Standard</option>
    <option value="upside">Analyst-Upside ↓</option>
    <option value="kgv">KGV ↑</option>
    <option value="dividende">Dividende ↓</option>
  </select>
</div>

<div class="table-wrap">
  <table id="watchlist-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th onclick="sortBy('name')">Aktie</th>
        <th onclick="sortBy('sector')">Sektor</th>
        <th onclick="sortBy('kurs')">Kurs</th>
        <th>Änderung</th>
        <th onclick="sortBy('kgv')">KGV</th>
        <th onclick="sortBy('dividende')">Dividende</th>
        <th onclick="sortBy('gewinn5j')">Gewinn 5J%</th>
        <th onclick="sortBy('upside')">Analyst-Upside</th>
        <th>Halal-Status</th>
        <th>Video</th>
        <th>Sparplan</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody id="watchlist-body">
      <tr><td colspan="11" style="text-align:center;padding:3rem;color:var(--muted)">Lade Daten…</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="disclaimer">
  ⚠️ <strong>Keine Anlageberatung.</strong> Diese Watchlist dient rein zu Informationszwecken. Halal-Bewertungen basieren auf AAOIFI-Standard Nr. 21.
</div>

<footer>
  <p>© 2026 Amana Aktien – Youssef Chafi · <a href="impressum.html">Impressum</a> · <a href="datenschutz.html">Datenschutz</a></p>
</footer>

